  - id: 2
    fadeOutSeconds: 0
    fadeInSeconds: 0
    beats:
    - speaker: SPASSKY
      line: I'm Officer Spassky. Nick is dead, and right now you're one of the suspects.
        I've already spoken to the others. Take your time and tell me everything
        you remember from last night.
      voClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f6b8cdde19cee4e4da3cecb257671884, type: 3}
      holdSecondsIfNoClip: 8
      memoryFlagToSet: 
      timeCard: 
      timeCardCaption: 
      timeCardHoldSeconds: 3.5
      dipToBlackBefore: 0
    keepScreenLit: 1
    endsBlack: 0
  - id: 28
    fadeOutSeconds: 0
    fadeInSeconds: 0
    beats:
    - speaker: DAVID
      line: You have to tell him, Nick. Say it out loud before Aaron works it out
        for himself.
      voClip: {fileID: 0}
      holdSecondsIfNoClip: 4
      memoryFlagToSet: 
      timeCard: 
      timeCardCaption: 
      timeCardHoldSeconds: 3.5
      dipToBlackBefore: 0
    - speaker: NICK
      line: Not tonight, David. I can't do this with you right now. I need some air.
      voClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 88814af1b2d9950419c8d640bb829119, type: 3}
      holdSecondsIfNoClip: 4
      memoryFlagToSet: 
